<title>UK: BOC pretax profit rises in Q1.</title>
<headline>BOC pretax profit rises in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.49		  vs 13.23</p>
<p> Pretax		     102.7		  vs 100.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   893.9		  vs 909.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 98 and 106 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - BOC Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
